# Nicenic API Integration Samples

This repository provides sample scripts and SDK examples for using the **Nicenic.NET API** across multiple programming languages.

---

### 🧩 Examples Included
- **Python**: Domain registration & status check  
- **PHP**: Reseller account API integration  
- **Node.js**: Domain renewal automation  
- **cURL**: Quick reference for testing endpoints  

---

### ⚙️ Getting Started
1. Obtain your API credentials from your Nicenic account.  
2. Set your API endpoint to  
   ➤ [https://nicenic.net/reseller/apiv2.php](https://nicenic.net/reseller/apiv2.php)  
3. Follow the README examples for your language of choice.  
4. Test endpoints in sandbox mode before production use.

